{"path":"utility/optional/begin","title":"std::optional<T>::begin","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::optional&lt;T&gt;::</span>begin","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/optional/begin","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"If *this contains a value, returns an iterator to the contained value. Otherwise, a past-the-end iterator value.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> iterator begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_iterator begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> contains a value, returns an iterator to the contained value. Otherwise, a past-the-end iterator value.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-image\">\n<p><img alt=\"range-begin-end.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/1/1b/range-begin-end.svg\" width=\"546\" height=\"157\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Iterator to the contained value if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">has_value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span>. Otherwise, a past-the-end iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_optional_range_support\"><code>__cpp_lib_optional_range_support</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/26#cpp_lib_optional_range_support_202406L\"><code>202406L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++26)</span></td>\n<td>Range support for <code>std::optional</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;optional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;print&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional\"><span class=\"kw1082\">std::<span class=\"me2\">optional</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> none <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/nullopt\"><span class=\"kw1086\">std::<span class=\"me2\">nullopt</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional\"><span class=\"kw1082\">std::<span class=\"me2\">optional</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> some <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>none.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> none.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>some.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> some.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// ranged-for loop support</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> none<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"'none' has a value of {}\"</span>, i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> some<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"'some' has a value of {}\"</span>, i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional\"><span class=\"kw1082\">std::<span class=\"me2\">optional</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> many<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> v <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> many<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"'many' has a value of {}\"</span>, v<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>'some' has a value of 42\n'many' has a value of [0, 1, 2]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>end</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/optional","title":"std::optional"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::optional<T>::begin","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++26. If *this contains a value, returns an iterator to the contained value."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Iterator to the contained value if has_value() is true. Otherwise,